<section id="testimoni" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/60 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Bukti Nyata &amp; Hasil Lapangan
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50 tracking-tight mb-4">
        Cerita Keberhasilan <span class="text-gradient">Upgrade Sistem</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Bagaimana perombakan alur kerja dan antarmuka oleh Kang Apri membantu tim operasional bekerja 3x lebih cepat tanpa beban server.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Grid with Real Named Stakeholders -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 mb-4 text-sm">
            ★★★★★
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
            "Dulu tim kasir kami selalu pusing tiap jam tutup kedai karena rekap nota manual makan waktu 1-2 jam. Setelah Kang Apri merombak sistem kasir ke form smartphone yang terhubung langsung ke Google Sheets &amp; Looker Studio, laba kotor dan stok bumbu terhitung otomatis dalam detik. Sangat menghemat waktu!"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800/60">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            🥩
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Riki Septian</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Head of Operations • Megumi Hotplate Cimahi</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 mb-4 text-sm">
            ★★★★★
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
            "Aplikasi KOMANDO benar-benar merevolusi jalannya kejuaraan Paskibra kami di Cimahi. Rekapitulasi nilai puluhan pleton yang biasanya bikin acara ngaret hingga 2 jam, selesai seketika dengan input juri digital 0 detik. Hasil klasemen juara langsung siap cetak ke PDF."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800/60">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            🏆
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Kang Hadid &amp; Tim Tabulasi</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Panitia Kejurcab Paskibra • MAN &amp; SMPN 3 Cimahi</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 mb-4 text-sm">
            ★★★★★
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
            "Arsitektur storefront Scalev dan otomatisasi draft invoice via Google Workspace yang dibangun Kang Apri membuat alur pemesanan jasa dokumen kami mengalir cepat tanpa ada lead WhatsApp yang tercecer. Pengelolaan 150+ proyek jadi sangat rapi."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800/60">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            📄
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Dian Pratama</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Managing Editor • Teras Tulis Agency</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
